--------------------------------------------------------------------------
SkyWater 130 nm PDK / open_pdks
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The design targets the open SkyWater `sky130A` process via open_pdks
(Apache-2.0 family). The PDK is an external, pinned build dependency. See:
  https://github.com/google/skywater-pdk
  https://github.com/RTimothyEdwards/open_pdks

