--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Hardware figure assets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The README hardware figure (docs/figures/fig_hardware_layout.{pdf,png}) is
composed from the layout, die-micrograph and daughter-board image assets
shipped under docs/figures/.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Metal-oxide odor dataset
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The olfaction experiments use a third-party metal-oxide gas-sensor dataset;
the derived result files under data/olfaction/ are provided here, and the raw
third-party features remain under their original dataset terms.
